fix for it! Sorry for the wait! Maybe launching on a Friday is a bad idea 😅\n\nThe problem was your minibits lightning provider doesn't publish the P tag with the payer's pubkey which our payment verification checks for. However, the pubkey is also available in the description tag, so we now fallback to that. No problem!\n\nAppreciate you trying it. I apologize for the problems but we just made our payment system more robust. Thanks again!\n\nEveryone who has already purchased your note will be able to unlock it now. No need to pay again. ","author":{"pubkey":"e8ed3798c6ffebffa08501ac39e271662bfd160f688f94c45d692d8767dd345a","name":"arkinox","picture":"https://i.nostr.build/1QEFRT2Zzwul92mu.jpg","nip05":"arkinox@team.fanfares.io","lud16":"arkinox@getalby.com"}},{"id":"fb63b2164292050bb2a42f1f76bd08792bbf5fec66be4ab7c01ca336943c0ebd","at":1756154301,"text":"Should be fixed now! I apologize for that but fixing this bug was very helpful! 🫡\n\nNo need to pay again. It should unlock next visit.","author":{"pubkey":"e8ed3798c6ffebffa08501ac39e271662bfd160f688f94c45d692d8767dd345a","name":"arkinox","picture":"https://i.nostr.build/1QEFRT2Zzwul92mu.jpg","nip05":"arkinox@team.fanfares.io","lud16":"arkinox@getalby.com"}},{"id":"dd6457a98ba5b85344a3b75365a6704141b04b9f3b9bafac17778f972f853c00","at":1756154382,"text":"Should be fixed now. No need to pay again. I apologize for the issues but we fixed a decent sized bug thanks to this so I appreciate it!\n\nLet me know if you have any more issues 🫡","author":{"pubkey":"e8ed3798c6ffebffa08501ac39e271662bfd160f688f94c45d692d8767dd345a","name":"arkinox","picture":"https://i.nostr.build/1QEFRT2Zzwul92mu.jpg","nip05":"arkinox@team.fanfares.io","lud16":"arkinox@getalby.com"}},{"id":"158621d12d2e4a4878a6880c41ba1fd39dea9bcf716aadd14aa404dbbe04c784","at":1756154563,"text":"FWIW We hope to integrate our functionality into as many other clients as possible so you don't need to use Fanfares to view purchased content","author":{"pubkey":"e8e